    "A still-image review cannot establish hidden interference, complete joint envelopes, contact forces or robot motion safety; the source-bound geometric/native/browser audits provide those separate checks.",
    "Optical alignment comments are visual observations of the rendered configurations, not measured calibration or a reconstruction of the internal optical prescription.",
    "Photo-derived dimensions, surface finishes and lighting remain estimates; visible reflections are not a claim of measured material BRDFs.",
    "The bonder geometric pupil view deliberately disables depth of field; its opaque central tool occlusion is expected and documented.",
    "No claim is made that this still renderer and the interactive browser renderer have identical lighting or shading; browser captures require a separate review."
